": "138872667", "author": {"steamid": "76561198348356563", "personaname": "VictorianFlower", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198348356563/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 9630, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 711, "last_played": 1786812338, "avatar": "a3b503e9bc1aab1b87e5c6560b6240c235b9cc67"}, "language": "english", "review": "Good crab, many crab, fun crab.", "timestamp_created": 1684883345, "timestamp_updated": 1684883345, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.519999980926513672", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1680364802", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 9, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "138870837", "author": {"steamid": "76561198251553398", "personaname": "Ohioisonfire96", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198251553398/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 9810, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3824, "last_played": 1789227927, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "As someone who had neared about 70 hours of playing this I can confidently say that this is one of the best roguelike games on the market. Every run feels so different with the amount of perks and builds that you can do. I can not wait for the continued support this game is getting and will get. I am sure there are so many ideas that are being considered as we speak. One suggestion I think would be good is some more melee perks as i think there is a good foundation for a tank build. I think also maybe having some other perks that black incoming bullets from sniper, shotgun, and other projectile crabs/ skulls would be a neat idea given an appropriate cool down or a passive perks that reduces the cool downs of all your other perks. The possibilities are endless and all I can say is that I am here for the full evolution of this game!", "timestamp_created": 1684880801, "timestamp_updated": 1684880801, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1680364802", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "138869418", "author": {"steamid": "76561198050126387", "personaname": "Snowbear", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198050126387/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 7868, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2787, "last_played": 1737644372, "avatar": "4fab73b8cea14fcc9b0b57e456c6fa65523dcea3"}, "language": "english", "review": "only done 46 hours but so far its a really fun roguelike game, i like the perk system and isnt increadibly hard but hard enough that you have to try and get a decent build. with all that its in alpha with many plans and just as it is its better than many AAA games nowadays.....", "timestamp_created": 1684878965, "timestamp_updated": 1684878965, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1680364802", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "138867970", "author": {"steamid": "76561198079583825", "personaname": "NEKOMENACE", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198079583825/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 14, "playtime_forever": 6702, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1459, "last_played": 1785878612, "avatar": "a6d72867733f3a9c6c80b3528b09de78603b0dcc"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game is great fun, and if you really want to put your skills to the test alongside nightmare attempt to run a greed run. Pick up every greed offer available! And I mean all of them!\n\n- Who needs health\n- Who needs to be immune to fall damage\n- Who needs to keep their money when getting punched\n\nRun on 1 health all the damage and all the money in the world! It's amazing XD", "timestamp_created": 1684877219, "timestamp_updated": 1684877219, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.517241418361663818", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1680364802", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "138867022", "author": {"steamid": "76561198872835820", "personaname": "QuizzyBunny", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/quizzybunny/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 7432, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 944, "last_played": 1780691095, "avatar": "336495dd4978c384b40274de16c6b7b1c91b3b0d"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's silly and it's good fun, I've enjoyed playing this with my friends!", "timestamp_created": 1684876061, "timestamp_updated": 1684876061, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1680364802", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "138863885", "author": {"steamid": "76561198950764900", "personaname": "ChromiumSud", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/chromiumsud/", "num_games_owned": 209, "num_reviews": 32, "playtime_forever": 14147, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at